 "The human-to-narrow-AI path is automation: each narrow ability (JAH-NARAI-000001 through JAH-NARAI-000019) replicates one human faculty at superhuman narrow fidelity while dropping generality. Machine vision (JAH-NARAI-000001) automates visual recognition beyond human spatial-visual intelligence (JAH-HUMI-000009); speech recognition (JAH-NARAI-000003) automates transcription beyond unaided ears; game agents (JAH-NARAI-000007) automate search beyond human lookahead; protein prediction (JAH-NARAI-000009) automates structural inference no human could compute. The path's recipe, as documented: formalize the task, collect massive labeled data, train hierarchical features, benchmark against humans. What does not transfer is everything the human records describe as general: fluid reasoning (JAH-HUMI-000001), linguistic generality (JAH-HUMI-000007), emotional intelligence (JAH-HUMI-000019). Descriptive result: ascension by automation climbs peaks, not the mountain — generality is the toll the path never pays.",
